{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y 对音乐内部的细微变化描写不如 X 细密，尤其是乐句起伏、情绪转折和声音质感的逐步变化，压缩后少了一些层次。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的叙述更连贯，动作、顾虑、心理反应之间的因果关系交代得自然，观众不必自己拼接很多零散信息，就能理解他为什么这样想、这样做。X 的关键词高亮和音乐同步出现的感受词很有优势，细节也更丰富，但部分段落意象切换过多，容易让注意力从人物主线转移到逐条解读感受词上。整体而言，Y 更适合一边听音乐一边理解人物经历，X 则在音乐感受的细腻程度上更胜一筹。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e3219b85-f5ba-48ae-bb07-527b1bdf626a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T000607531297Z", "elapsed_seconds": 66.609, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:07:14.152341+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4bbeccfc9d8646347585ee93bb5d459fd3c801d5f687ecc77ab950254c8051ad", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt